
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5041

# Wklej identyfikatory produktu i stanowiska
# z poprzednich dni.
@productId = d034b22e-273b-4caf-bbbd-bcceda274570
@workCenterId = 97b1c0db-9fc7-4e09-9c0b-be90bcb00b22

# Uzupełnij po utworzeniu trzech zleceń.
@transitionOrderId = 8396aee2-722c-49c3-9400-a76a821bb7ca
@cancelDraftOrderId = 6eae5031-f5dd-402e-9ab1-81b874d9a237
@cancelReleasedOrderId = d1d6178b-b790-4ede-9d4e-a3cdc9204ab7


### 1. Utworzenie zlecenia do zmiany statusów
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "PF-STATUS-001",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "workCenterId": "{{workCenterId}}",
  "plannedQuantity": 100,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-15"
}


### 2. Utworzenie zlecenia do anulowania z Draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "PF-STATUS-002",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "workCenterId": "{{workCenterId}}",
  "plannedQuantity": 150,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-16"
}


### 3. Utworzenie zlecenia do anulowania z Released
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "PF-STATUS-003",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "workCenterId": "{{workCenterId}}",
  "plannedQuantity": 200,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-17"
}


### 4. Pobranie pierwszego zlecenia
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{transitionOrderId}}
Accept: application/json


### 5. Nieprawidłowe Start ze statusu Draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{transitionOrderId}}/start


### 6. Poprawne Release
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{transitionOrderId}}/release


### 7. Ponowne Release - niedozwolone
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{transitionOrderId}}/release


### 8. Poprawne Start
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{transitionOrderId}}/start


### 9. Próba Cancel ze statusu InProgress
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{transitionOrderId}}/cancel


### 10. Sprawdzenie statusu InProgress
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{transitionOrderId}}
Accept: application/json


### 11. Anulowanie zlecenia Draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{cancelDraftOrderId}}/cancel


### 12. Ponowne anulowanie - niedozwolone
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{cancelDraftOrderId}}/cancel


### 13. Próba Release anulowanego zlecenia
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{cancelDraftOrderId}}/release


### 14. Release trzeciego zlecenia
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{cancelReleasedOrderId}}/release


### 15. Cancel ze statusu Released
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{cancelReleasedOrderId}}/cancel


### 16. Odczyt anulowanego zlecenia
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{cancelReleasedOrderId}}
Accept: application/json


### 17. Zmiana statusu nieistniejącego zlecenia
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/release
